BT /F2 16 Tf 72 710 Td (Chapter 1 – Too Much Running) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (Rue the fox had been running all day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (She had chased butterflies across the clover field,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (splashed through every puddle on the forest path,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (and climbed the tallest hill three times, just because.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 608 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 590 Td (By the time evening came, even Rue's shadow felt tired.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 572 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 554 Td ("What now?" she asked herself.) Tj ET
endstream
