BT /F2 16 Tf 72 710 Td (Chapter 2 – The Giant Mushroom) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (Deep in the forest, Rue found a mushroom) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (wider than her favourite tree stump,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (with a cap that glowed faintly amber in the dark.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 608 Td (Fireflies drifted around it like tiny, quiet thoughts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 590 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 572 Td (Rue stopped. For the first time all day, she simply... stopped.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 554 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 536 Td (She sat down in the soft moss and watched.) Tj ET
