BT /F2 16 Tf 72 710 Td (Chapter 3 – What She Heard) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (She heard the forest breathing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (An owl asking a quiet question somewhere above.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (A beetle tapping a secret message on a nearby root.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (The distant brook, telling its long, unhurried story.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 608 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 590 Td (Rue had been in this forest a hundred times.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 572 Td (She had never heard any of this before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 554 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 536 Td ("I was too fast," she realised.) Tj ET
endstream
